**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Node.js (Frontend)
**/node_modules/
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/.pnpm-debug.log*

# Next.js build output
**/.next/
**/out/

# IDE files
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.suo
**/*.ntvs*
**/*.njsproj
**/*.sln
**/*.sw?

# OS files
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# App data or logs
**/*.log

